SUMMARY: Music in St. James Park -- 2026 Summer Season
DESCRIPTION:An evening of classic soul\, R&B and funk featuring The Natur
 al Women Revue.\n\nThe Natural Women Revue celebrates the iconic music of
  legendary artists such as Gladys Knight\, Chaka Khan\, and Aretha Frankl
 in along with other influential women who shaped Black music throughout t
 he 1960s\, 1970s\, and 1980s.\n\nTheir dynamic live show delivers the tim
 eless soul\, energy\, and sophistication of this unforgettable era\, a cr
 owd-pleasing sound and an experience audiences will never forget.\n\nMusi
 c in St. James Park is a summer series of concerts on Thursday nights in 
 June\, July and August presented by the Old Town Toronto BIA.\n\nFree\n\n
