SUMMARY: Berczy Beats -- Lunchtime Music Series\, 2026
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy some music with your lunch\, featuring Erica Knox.\n\nF
 rom upbeat excitement to mellow nostalgia\, Erica Knox is reinventing her
  sound with self- portrayed intimate lyrics about love\, life\, and ident
 ity\, alongside catchy hooks\, reminiscent of modern day hitmakers Gracie
  Abrams and Maisie Peters. With her recent coverage in NME Magazine\, and
  work at Abbey Road Studios with Grammy nominated musician and producer\,
  Hannah V\, the ‘Best Emerging Artist in Canada’ nominee is currently fin
 alizing her first EP\, set to release this year.\n\nBerczy Beats is a ser
 ies of lunchtime summer concerts on Wednesdays in July and August present
 ed by the Old Town Toronto BIA.\n\nFree
