SUMMARY: Women's Entrepreneurship Hub (WE-Hub)
DESCRIPTION:Women's Entrepreneurship Hub (WE-Hub) is now (as of August 11
 ) accepting applications for autumn cohorts.\n\nThis free program is offe
 red by Scadding Court Community Centre in partnership with the Diversity 
 Institute at Toronto Metropolitan University (TMU). It is funded by the p
 rovincial government.\n\nStarts September 26\, 2026\n\nEligibility: Open 
 to women and non-binary folks. Must be considered low-income by the provi
 nce and reside in GTA\n\nFormat:\n\n  * 6-weeks hybrid training @ TMU\;\n
   * + childcare and TTC cards\;\n  * access to a business mentor\, specia
 lized skill clinics\, networking\, and vendor testing opportunities\;\n  
 * wrap-around supports related to: settlement\, career\, family\, GBV sup
 port and mental health referrals.\n\nCertificates are granted upon comple
 tion.\n\nApplication: https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdS7_RiOPX
 IhJhz1q_sbGI3RZilmJANq7sCCQ3mpcO34dGTxA/viewform?pli=1 [docs.google.com] 
 https://urldefense.com/v3/__https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdS7
 _RiOPXIhJhz1q_sbGI3RZilmJANq7sCCQ3mpcO34dGTxA/viewform?pli=1__\;!!KW-VMAO
 DMJ4p!27kMK89HisKl-DCL6_WCxmY5K5zX3xph2uA9ceYcpLfPEQXwBGXY_qbHDz9F1m9bZ7g
 1uTZFvonNvfaVa0Md$\n\nFunded by Ontario Ministry of Children\, Community 
 and Social Services.\n\n
