SUMMARY: Trivia Night @ St. James Cathedral
DESCRIPTION:Bring yourself\, your friends and your trivia teammates to th
 e 2nd Annual "Food for Thought" Trivia Night at St. James Cathedral.\n\nT
 his year's fund raiser will help support two vital programs at the St. Ja
 mes Cathedral Drop-In:\n\n  * the free foot care clinic and\n  * the week
 ly Friday meal program\n\nThese services provide essential care\, nourish
 ment\, and connection for people experiencing homelessness\, social isola
 tion\, food insecurity\, and those seeking a welcoming community.\n\nMC'd
  by Indie Pop musician Sarah-Jayne Riley\, all the fun begins at 6:00 PM.
  The games begin at 7:00 PM.\n\nTickets: $40.00 each\; table of 8: $280.0
 0. All tickets include trivia game & meal.\n\nMore information and ticket
  purchase: stjamescathedral.ca/trivianight http://www.stjamescathedral.ca
 /trivianight
